#: ../../../reference/accessibility/orca-preferences/orca-preferences-chat.md:0
msgid ""
"Configure how Orca behaves in instant messaging and IRC chat clients, such "
"as announcing chatroom names and typing status."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/accessibility/orca-preferences/orca-preferences-chat.md:7
msgid "Chat preferences"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/accessibility/orca-preferences/orca-preferences-chat.md:9
msgid ""
"The following options allow you to customize how Orca behaves when providing "
"access to instant messaging and internet relay chat clients."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/accessibility/orca-preferences/orca-preferences-chat.md:11
msgid "Speak chatroom name"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/accessibility/orca-preferences/orca-preferences-chat.md:13
msgid ""
"If this checkbox is checked, Orca will prefix incoming messages with the "
"name of the room or buddy they came from, unless they came from the "
"currently-focused conversation."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/accessibility/orca-preferences/orca-preferences-chat.md:15
#: ../../../reference/accessibility/orca-preferences/orca-preferences-chat.md:21
msgid "**Default value:** not checked"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/accessibility/orca-preferences/orca-preferences-chat.md:17
msgid "Announce when your buddies are typing"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/accessibility/orca-preferences/orca-preferences-chat.md:19
msgid ""
"If this checkbox is checked, and if Orca has sufficient information "
"identifying that your buddy is typing, Orca will announce changes in typing "
"status."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/accessibility/orca-preferences/orca-preferences-chat.md:23
msgid "Provide chat room specific message histories"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/accessibility/orca-preferences/orca-preferences-chat.md:25
msgid ""
"If this checkbox is checked, Orca's commands for reviewing recent messages "
"will only apply to the currently-focused conversation. Otherwise, the "
"history will contain the most recent messages regardless of which "
"conversation they came from."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/accessibility/orca-preferences/orca-preferences-chat.md:27
msgid "**Default value**: not checked"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/accessibility/orca-preferences/orca-preferences-chat.md:29
msgid "Speak messages from"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/accessibility/orca-preferences/orca-preferences-chat.md:31
msgid ""
"This group of radio buttons allows you to control under what circumstances "
"Orca will present an incoming message to you. Your choices are:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/accessibility/orca-preferences/orca-preferences-chat.md:33
msgid "All channels"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/accessibility/orca-preferences/orca-preferences-chat.md:35
msgid "A channel only if its window is active"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/accessibility/orca-preferences/orca-preferences-chat.md:37
msgid "All channels when any chat window is active"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/accessibility/orca-preferences/orca-preferences-chat.md:39
msgid "**Default value:** all channels"
msgstr ""
